WEBVTT

00:04.533 --> 00:06.825
Oh... mornin'!

00:08.306 --> 00:10.225
What's up with this situation?

00:10.616 --> 00:12.214
Is this a sign that I'll die tomorrow?

00:13.050 --> 00:14.063
Stop it.

00:14.536 --> 00:17.550
Say... I was thinking about this last night,

00:18.120 --> 00:20.469
but what does your dad call you, Ichikawa?

00:21.117 --> 00:23.508
He hasn't been calling me lately,

00:24.216 --> 00:25.775
but usually Kyo-chan or Kyo.

00:26.595 --> 00:27.721
What about your friends?

00:28.342 --> 00:30.333
Like, Ichikawa or Ichikawa-kun.

00:30.978 --> 00:31.978
Then...

00:33.022 --> 00:34.818
...can I go with Kyotaro?

00:35.700 --> 00:36.700
My name for you.

00:39.284 --> 00:40.150
It's...

00:40.692 --> 00:41.892
...a sign I'll die today.

02:14.924 --> 02:15.924
I'll call you.

02:16.524 --> 02:17.134
Sure.

02:17.761 --> 02:18.814
Apparently, Yamada is

02:19.216 --> 02:21.766
going to Hiroshima today
for her filming.

02:24.211 --> 02:25.877
I couldn't wish her "good luck"...

02:27.062 --> 02:28.182
And so, I...

02:28.582 --> 02:31.060
Yuu had a... love scandal...

02:31.127 --> 02:32.474
Stayed with him overnight...

02:32.770 --> 02:33.963
I believe her.

02:34.344 --> 02:38.742
"We're just close friends and were only
playing games all night", or so she said.

02:39.000 --> 02:41.051
Heh. No way.

02:41.281 --> 02:42.188
I know, right?

02:42.189 --> 02:45.540
Still, being a fan, he'll believe in
his favorite idol no matter what happens.

02:45.730 --> 02:47.069
- Damn right...
- Why did I...

02:47.787 --> 02:49.169
...feel a sting in my heart?

02:50.291 --> 02:51.930
Still, sakura viewing...

02:52.158 --> 02:54.391
I'd heard rumors,
but who knew it's a thing?

02:55.001 --> 02:57.347
Did they really call me here for this?

02:58.066 --> 02:59.566
Yo, if it ain't Icchi!

03:01.734 --> 03:02.974
I knew it.

03:03.217 --> 03:05.900
I thought I heard some familiar voices.

03:08.198 --> 03:09.664
Why are you guys here?

03:10.154 --> 03:12.911
We were having
man-to-man talks about finance.

03:13.390 --> 03:16.236
So you're not talking about
Yuu's exposed affair?

03:17.210 --> 03:19.825
They should be free to kiss.
To stay over together too.

03:20.440 --> 03:21.679
As long as they're dating.

03:22.626 --> 03:26.610
I mean really, staying over if
they're not even dating?

03:26.634 --> 03:28.928
Even Moe here would be disappointed.

03:29.087 --> 03:30.760
Ain't that right, Icchi?

03:32.086 --> 03:33.655
I-I see...

03:33.822 --> 03:36.901
Yamada slept over at the house of
a guy she's not even dating...

03:37.525 --> 03:39.915
It's an indisputable, objective fact.

03:40.602 --> 03:43.974
Even though she's not
as famous as Yuu, but still...

03:44.695 --> 03:48.134
Being in a relationship with you might
be problematic for her work too...

03:48.999 --> 03:51.294
What if something terrible happens?

03:51.798 --> 03:53.718
Right, let's send it to Yamada.

03:53.991 --> 03:55.038
Say "cheese"!

03:56.554 --> 03:57.787
W-Wait a sec!

03:58.221 --> 04:00.978
Huh? Come to think of it,
why isn't Yamada here too?

04:01.345 --> 04:03.865
She'll start shooting at
Hiroshima from tomorrow.

04:04.104 --> 04:05.877
She went in advance today.

04:06.264 --> 04:08.563
She'll be playing Ken Kataoka's daughter.

04:08.962 --> 04:11.250
Wow, awesome!

04:11.415 --> 04:13.670
She's getting more amazing day by day.

04:19.363 --> 04:21.709
Still, Yamada still acts like herself.

04:22.709 --> 04:23.513
She hasn't changed one bit.

04:24.117 --> 04:24.830
Right?

04:25.923 --> 04:28.233
I saw her do it the other day.

04:28.233 --> 04:30.566
She put Ramune in a double-patty burger!

04:30.854 --> 04:31.919
-No way.
-Yeah...

04:32.572 --> 04:33.679
Hasn't changed a bit...

04:34.126 --> 04:34.899
...huh.

04:36.672 --> 04:37.498
But...

04:39.100 --> 04:40.822
This hotel is super pretty!

04:41.365 --> 04:42.365
Want a room tour?

04:42.996 --> 04:44.843
There are things that ought to change.

04:45.892 --> 04:46.892
Listen...

04:48.020 --> 04:49.020
G-Gimme a sec.

04:53.412 --> 04:54.245
Mom...

04:54.865 --> 04:55.865
Say, Anna...

04:56.091 --> 04:57.524
Let's talk for a bit.

04:58.881 --> 04:59.881
In the end,

05:00.274 --> 05:02.306
I couldn't say anything to her that day.

05:06.863 --> 05:07.942
How pretty...

05:09.475 --> 05:10.528
Don't you think so, Anna?

05:13.811 --> 05:14.811
Guess I am.

05:15.104 --> 05:16.104
I meant the view.

05:17.284 --> 05:19.111
Mr. Ken Kataoka has arrived!

05:20.300 --> 05:21.826
- Good morning.
- Nice to meet you.

05:22.079 --> 05:23.838
Come on now, relax a little.

05:24.263 --> 05:24.922
Right.

05:26.943 --> 05:29.454
(Finally, it's time to shoot! Hehehe)
(All the best.)

05:33.703 --> 05:35.085
(You'll be fine.)

05:35.944 --> 05:39.855
What an ordinary and
irresponsible thing to say.

05:40.678 --> 05:41.678
Maybe...

05:41.912 --> 05:44.267
...she got chewed out
by her mom for staying over.

05:44.840 --> 05:47.013
She's no regular
middle school kid after all.

05:47.339 --> 05:49.393
I need to be more
aware of my behavior too.

05:54.207 --> 05:55.393
Wait, this is...!

05:56.251 --> 05:56.917
No way!

05:59.026 --> 06:00.525
No, no, no, no, no!

06:00.965 --> 06:01.965
I knew it!

06:02.197 --> 06:04.530
What have you done, Yamada?!

06:04.742 --> 06:06.370
This cannot be good!

06:06.383 --> 06:07.951
(This isn't where you usually
take pics. Boyfriend's house?)

06:08.164 --> 06:11.061
You see?! There are sharp guys out there!

06:13.263 --> 06:14.583
(Who gifted you that bracelet?)

06:15.090 --> 06:16.710
(Elaborate hairstyle= a Christmas date?)

06:17.471 --> 06:19.598
(This is Mita's main store, third seat from the back!)
One of those long paragraphs fans like to write...

06:19.868 --> 06:21.254
(I like sitting there as well...)
They're all from the same account.

06:21.254 --> 06:22.215
(Maybe we've sat in the same seat?)

06:22.352 --> 06:24.158
(Pig man)
Pig man?

06:25.371 --> 06:28.392
Seems like a middle-aged dude
who is obsessed with models.

06:28.688 --> 06:29.748
(I wanna die)

06:30.300 --> 06:31.380
(The taxi passed me by again...
Do I even exist?)

06:31.875 --> 06:33.026
(So hard...)

06:33.559 --> 06:34.712
(I'm already at home,
but I wanna go home...)

06:35.095 --> 06:36.528
He's got major issues!

06:36.855 --> 06:38.982
(Anna Akino's face is so perfect, I look at it everyday...
she's the hope in my life... a ray of light...)

06:39.134 --> 06:41.568
(the hope in my life...)
The hope in his life...

06:46.364 --> 06:47.431
(Ken Kataoka caught with 28 mistresses
in a dazzling nightlife exposé.)

06:47.431 --> 06:49.284
(nightlife)
Nightlife?!

06:51.071 --> 06:52.471
What the hell did you write?

06:52.471 --> 06:54.956
(Has Anna also been taken?! It's all over...)
Don't just say it's over!

06:55.358 --> 06:57.095
What was that, you pig bastard?

06:57.541 --> 06:59.822
Rumors like these tend to
spread on their own,

06:59.842 --> 07:02.998
and someone who makes a fuss
for the heck of it will definitely emerge.

07:02.998 --> 07:05.384
(Shares) (Likes)
It's spreading rapidly...

07:06.987 --> 07:08.511
I didn't want to do this, but...

07:09.554 --> 07:12.140
(You should delete this post. You'll cause
trouble for this person named Akino.)

07:12.493 --> 07:13.493
Good grief,

07:13.576 --> 07:16.886
don't go developing
such a personality, Mr. Fan.

07:18.146 --> 07:18.995
(@pig_man1209 has blocked you)

07:18.995 --> 07:20.781
Instantly blocked?

07:22.388 --> 07:23.866
The decision is mine to make!

07:24.440 --> 07:27.703
You can't only act like
a father when it suits you!

07:31.870 --> 07:32.870
Cut!

07:34.378 --> 07:35.378
I'm so sorry.

07:35.665 --> 07:37.159
I'm not supposed to cry here...

07:37.509 --> 07:40.229
No, that right there was great. Wasn't it?

07:41.797 --> 07:43.310
They were barely brimming over.

07:44.110 --> 07:46.323
You're from Tecchan's agency, right?

07:46.900 --> 07:47.900
Y-Yes.

07:48.499 --> 07:49.499
Nicely done.

07:49.643 --> 07:50.643
Rather than anger,

07:50.899 --> 07:52.526
that there felt more like anxiety.

07:54.847 --> 07:57.574
That's just right for a teen, it is.

08:00.844 --> 08:03.990
So, I also got the opportunity to
observe the subsequent filming...

08:04.597 --> 08:07.563
Mr. Ken Kataoka sure is amazing, yeah?

08:08.197 --> 08:10.350
But you were the one who received praise.

08:10.918 --> 08:12.742
Doesn't that mean you're the amazing one?

08:13.033 --> 08:14.392
Nah, not quite.

08:15.311 --> 08:16.311
While acting, I was wondering...

08:17.146 --> 08:19.869
...why I cried during that scene...

08:21.095 --> 08:22.348
And in that moment, I...

08:25.636 --> 08:27.063
It was only for a bit, but...

08:27.841 --> 08:29.894
I felt like I could tap into
your emotions, Ichikawa.

08:31.531 --> 08:33.582
The irritation and anxiety you
feel towards yourself.

08:35.236 --> 08:36.236
Mr. Kataoka

08:36.582 --> 08:38.582
saw through that, I think.

08:39.692 --> 08:40.394
So...

08:40.966 --> 08:41.966
I'm really glad...

08:42.433 --> 08:44.979
we spent the night that day together.

08:46.098 --> 08:48.434
Well... I did get in trouble
with my mom though...

08:48.934 --> 08:49.934
I knew it...

08:50.301 --> 08:51.367
She was angry, huh?

08:52.193 --> 08:52.866
Yeah.

08:53.513 --> 08:54.586
Don't lie to me.

08:55.208 --> 08:56.208
I shouldn't say that, though.

08:56.714 --> 08:59.539
I used to lie to my parents
all the time back then too.

09:00.323 --> 09:03.430
But, I genuinely want to support you,

09:03.830 --> 09:05.594
so don't forget that.

09:09.699 --> 09:11.611
T-Thank you!

09:12.963 --> 09:13.963
That's my line!

09:15.029 --> 09:16.029
I get it.

09:17.116 --> 09:18.323
It was not meaningless...

09:18.663 --> 09:19.665
...not one bit of it.

09:20.316 --> 09:22.555
Not the sleepover,
and not even my anxiety.

09:25.765 --> 09:27.292
Her mom's there with her,

09:27.546 --> 09:30.186
so there's probably no need
to worry about the filming.

09:30.728 --> 09:31.728
The problem is...

09:32.559 --> 09:36.739
If she posts something like this again,
the fans will start gossiping.

09:38.660 --> 09:39.370
Hey,

09:39.862 --> 09:42.745
Can I use this photo with Anna
to brag to my friends?

09:43.856 --> 09:45.502
I'm talking about this one.

09:45.877 --> 09:47.381
Don't you dare!

09:47.422 --> 09:48.713
Delete it right now.

09:48.763 --> 09:50.006
Microwave the whole device.

09:51.525 --> 09:52.467
(Delete this?) (Delete)

09:54.980 --> 09:56.679
(Pig man)

09:57.808 --> 09:59.057
(I won't forgive him,
I won't forgive him, die, die, die)

09:59.057 --> 10:00.558
(Her filming location is Onomichi!
My hometown...)

10:03.478 --> 10:04.478
What's up?

10:07.462 --> 10:08.115
Why...

10:08.775 --> 10:10.396
...does my chest hurt like this?

10:12.813 --> 10:15.313
I've been through
what this dude's feeling...

10:17.472 --> 10:18.472
Love turns

10:18.779 --> 10:19.779
to hatred.

10:24.271 --> 10:25.271
Can you see?

10:25.670 --> 10:27.170
I wonder if that's Shikoku.

10:27.927 --> 10:31.019
You mean... Shinanami Kaido, or something?

10:31.167 --> 10:32.167
Not sure.

10:32.421 --> 10:34.394
How do you not know where you are?

10:35.139 --> 10:37.045
Anyway, you alone right now?

10:37.458 --> 10:39.806
Yup. Mom's attending a work call.

10:40.264 --> 10:41.843
So you can say whatever you want.

10:42.174 --> 10:43.575
That's not it.

10:44.479 --> 10:48.022
It'll be too much to tell her
that there's a dangerous fan nearby.

10:48.652 --> 10:49.731
You see, umm...

10:50.052 --> 10:51.698
Watch your back.

10:52.204 --> 10:54.344
Could it be... you saw it?

10:54.998 --> 10:56.777
Virgo's in the lowest position today.

10:57.131 --> 10:59.941
But I don't believe in bad outcomes, so...

10:59.941 --> 11:01.452
Oh, you're speaking in dialect.

11:01.971 --> 11:03.497
Girls with dialects are cute, no?

11:07.245 --> 11:07.884
Yamada?

11:08.509 --> 11:09.175
Yamada?!

11:12.505 --> 11:16.009
(Anna Yamada)

11:23.264 --> 11:26.269
(No response)
(Redial)
(Leave a voice note)

11:28.254 --> 11:29.254
It can't be...

11:36.924 --> 11:38.637
Well, I'm sure she's okay.

11:40.037 --> 11:41.037
She'll be okay.

11:43.661 --> 11:44.454
She'll be okay.

11:44.873 --> 11:45.931
She'll be okay...

11:50.250 --> 11:52.253
(What happened?)
(Hey)

11:55.254 --> 11:58.444
(Have you heard from Yamada?)

11:58.444 --> 11:59.874
(Got dumped, huh?)

11:59.874 --> 12:01.512
(Too bad.)

12:08.242 --> 12:10.071
This is definitely weird.

12:12.381 --> 12:13.388
You should go.

12:13.708 --> 12:14.708
Calm down for now.

12:18.196 --> 12:18.864
No.

12:19.392 --> 12:21.324
I'm going. Even if she hates me for it.

12:33.805 --> 12:35.417
W-What a coincidence.

12:35.676 --> 12:37.282
I was just looking for shelter...

12:37.835 --> 12:39.014
I just need to make sure

12:39.437 --> 12:40.477
that she's safe.

12:42.065 --> 12:43.331
It's 11 pm.

12:44.045 --> 12:45.412
Maybe I can tell if she's safe

12:45.990 --> 12:47.559
by seeing how her father's acting.

12:48.438 --> 12:50.371
It's pretty cold, but it'll probably be fine.

12:53.838 --> 12:54.618
You're freezing.

12:55.292 --> 12:55.925
Come on in.

13:07.259 --> 13:09.430
This is some next level cooking...

13:11.234 --> 13:12.234
It's pretty late,

13:12.661 --> 13:14.287
so make sure you inform your parents.

13:15.695 --> 13:18.527
Kids staying out late at
other people's houses...

13:21.230 --> 13:23.384
Crap. He's kinda mad.

13:23.858 --> 13:26.756
(Where are you going at this hour?!)
Thinking about it, this is creepy.

13:27.159 --> 13:29.079
I can't judge the pig guy.

13:33.177 --> 13:34.584
Oh, Anna?

13:37.024 --> 13:37.822
Now?

13:38.876 --> 13:40.496
Huh? Contact him?

13:41.542 --> 13:43.188
Calm down. Where?

13:44.274 --> 13:45.434
Yeah. Yeah.

13:46.073 --> 13:46.993
Yeah, yeah.

13:47.702 --> 13:48.370
What?

13:50.521 --> 13:52.214
Do you know where this is?

13:54.243 --> 13:55.422
This is...

13:56.249 --> 14:01.327
Anna dropped her phone in the water
and couldn't contact anyone...

14:04.563 --> 14:05.936
Let me call again.

14:06.250 --> 14:07.729
- It's my house.
- Huh?

14:08.912 --> 14:09.792
It's my house!

14:10.725 --> 14:11.476
This place.

14:18.256 --> 14:19.256
I see.

14:24.840 --> 14:28.271
Jeez, what is it, Yuki?
Are you that lonely?

14:29.619 --> 14:30.370
Umm...

14:31.641 --> 14:32.641
Who are you?

14:33.014 --> 14:34.014
I-It's Ichikawa.

14:34.584 --> 14:35.584
Ichikawa.

14:36.002 --> 14:37.835
- Ichikawa?
- Kyotaro!

14:38.409 --> 14:39.815
Um, so, umm...

14:39.822 --> 14:42.048
My mom was coming,
and right as I was looking back,

14:42.048 --> 14:43.591
I dropped my phone in the water,

14:43.591 --> 14:45.134
and I couldn't get it back,

14:45.134 --> 14:46.886
and I thought you'd be worried

14:46.886 --> 14:48.220
so I wrote you a letter...

14:48.740 --> 14:50.598
Wait, take a deep breath.

14:50.872 --> 14:52.975
But why are you there?

14:53.857 --> 14:55.563
Why indeed...

14:56.884 --> 14:59.357
You can recover your data
through the cloud.

14:59.930 --> 15:00.776
Yeah.

15:01.270 --> 15:01.994
Umm..

15:04.975 --> 15:05.708
Mom...

15:07.803 --> 15:08.436
I...

15:10.412 --> 15:11.412
...love...

15:13.091 --> 15:13.837
I...

15:14.636 --> 15:15.636
...love...

15:18.079 --> 15:19.138
- Anna.
- Kyotaro.

15:24.658 --> 15:26.271
My feelings aren't half-hearted,

15:27.288 --> 15:28.288
that's why...

15:28.628 --> 15:30.448
I deeply regret making her stay over...

15:37.680 --> 15:38.486
My friend code.

15:39.161 --> 15:40.667
Let's play together.

15:45.912 --> 15:47.031
So after all that,

15:47.905 --> 15:49.924
my turbulent spring break
has finally ended.

15:53.119 --> 15:54.617
(Aaaaa) (Aaaaa. What is this)
(Resurrection ceremony)

15:54.617 --> 15:56.642
(I'm back in Tokyo, so I'm at Ramen-ro)
(The taste of Tokyo!)

15:56.642 --> 15:59.861
Isn't there something that
represents the taste of Tokyo more?

16:02.041 --> 16:03.041
Umm,

16:03.315 --> 16:05.790
I guess I can access him
through this other account.

16:06.300 --> 16:07.091
(I found her)

16:07.091 --> 16:08.718
(Anna)

16:13.022 --> 16:14.744
(Are you at the Mita main store?)
That's right.

16:15.430 --> 16:16.955
(This is Mita's main store...)
He'd talked about it earlier.

16:18.102 --> 16:19.102
Why didn't I notice?

16:20.956 --> 16:22.148
This is how it always is.

16:22.591 --> 16:25.484
Danger strikes right when you feel safe!

16:25.484 --> 16:26.461
(Ramen-ro, Mita Main Store)

16:26.461 --> 16:27.294
Yamada...

16:28.235 --> 16:29.120
Yamada!

16:31.266 --> 16:32.266
Kyo...

16:37.121 --> 16:38.250
An acquaintance?

16:38.567 --> 16:39.567
Umm...

16:40.344 --> 16:41.770
Oh, I see.

16:42.134 --> 16:43.157
You, from the other day.

16:44.956 --> 16:45.956
This person...

16:46.216 --> 16:47.556
she was there at the shooting.

16:47.945 --> 16:49.720
The model Yamada admired...

16:50.540 --> 16:52.260
Anyway, the pig guy is...

16:53.028 --> 16:54.654
We just met by chance...

16:55.101 --> 16:57.274
I actually want to
take her elsewhere, but...

16:57.875 --> 16:59.268
That person is here right now.

17:00.234 --> 17:02.633
Yamada, can I also come along?

17:04.164 --> 17:05.642
Yeah!

17:07.836 --> 17:08.836
Welcome!

17:10.164 --> 17:12.848
Please take the third seat from the back.

17:13.076 --> 17:14.076
Thank you.

17:16.836 --> 17:19.164
(...third seat from the back!)

17:20.171 --> 17:21.836
There's no way...

17:22.433 --> 17:23.836
That fashion model?

17:27.836 --> 17:28.774
Pig man...

17:32.075 --> 17:33.760
So easy to read!

17:34.225 --> 17:35.225
Have at it!

17:36.590 --> 17:39.417
I got a small ramen
with no toppings, though...

17:39.766 --> 17:40.766
Yeah, that's the one.

17:41.483 --> 17:44.735
I see, I've read this
about Ramen-ro before.

17:49.311 --> 17:52.651
For some reason, they only take
5 people at a time, in a single "lot".

17:53.106 --> 17:55.886
If anyone's a slow eater, they're called
a "lot-disruptor" and get shunned.

17:56.812 --> 17:59.898
I can't. This isn't the kind of place
you enter lightly.

18:04.670 --> 18:05.503
She's fast!

18:15.323 --> 18:16.056
I'm...

18:19.766 --> 18:20.766
Thanatos.

18:22.794 --> 18:23.794
Tha... na...?

18:24.061 --> 18:25.514
Instantly blocked!

18:27.066 --> 18:28.066
Yamada's...

18:28.287 --> 18:29.902
Anna Akino's... fan.

18:30.743 --> 18:31.743
So...

18:32.766 --> 18:33.766
I also...

18:34.875 --> 18:36.768
Anna's great, isn't she?

18:37.421 --> 18:39.156
She's cute, and cool...

18:39.617 --> 18:40.956
Composed, and mature...

18:41.886 --> 18:42.886
She's perfect.

18:44.144 --> 18:45.637
An enthusiastic fan...

18:46.290 --> 18:49.493
As Yamada gets more famous
there will be more of them too...

18:50.685 --> 18:51.265
Still...

18:52.099 --> 18:53.312
I'm the one who knows her.

18:54.809 --> 18:56.079
She's not perfect.

18:56.502 --> 18:57.878
Anna Yamada isn't.

19:01.820 --> 19:03.540
I won.

19:05.223 --> 19:07.512
Put the bowl up there.

19:13.857 --> 19:14.737
How slow.

19:17.499 --> 19:18.499
Oh?

19:18.652 --> 19:20.993
Did you get taller since
the last time I saw you?

19:21.566 --> 19:23.750
Saying that like you're a relative.
I'm wearing heels.

19:25.550 --> 19:26.456
Ichikawa...

19:26.536 --> 19:27.696
your shoes are mismatched.

19:27.917 --> 19:29.503
Huh? O-Oh, this is...

19:29.503 --> 19:31.323
Did you get here in a rush?

19:34.809 --> 19:35.809
Anna...

19:35.983 --> 19:37.529
Make that face again!

19:37.859 --> 19:39.350
Damn, so cute!

19:41.682 --> 19:42.916
I, umm...

19:43.346 --> 19:47.326
No, I too,
have always admired you, Niko...

19:48.532 --> 19:50.389
Please have lunch with me again!

19:51.613 --> 19:55.157
I'm the type who likes to keep an
appropriate distance from idols.

19:55.571 --> 19:56.571
A fan...

19:57.027 --> 19:59.687
Well, it's fine if it's a mutual love.

20:00.033 --> 20:00.766
See ya.

20:01.006 --> 20:02.006
Ah, wait!

20:04.380 --> 20:08.200
Don't you ever upload
Yamada's private information again.

20:08.473 --> 20:10.880
Dunno what you're talking about.

20:16.621 --> 20:17.534
(I've unblocked you)

20:17.534 --> 20:18.994
(If you want Anna's school pics...)
I exchanged contact info...

20:19.174 --> 20:21.890
(Line Invite URL)
...with a fashion model?

20:30.217 --> 20:30.996
I'm sorry...

20:31.317 --> 20:32.317
...about the phone.

20:32.745 --> 20:33.997
You must've been worried.

20:34.631 --> 20:35.264
N-No...

20:35.678 --> 20:38.138
My own delusions made me worry...

20:40.424 --> 20:41.015
But...

20:44.733 --> 20:49.626
There are many people in the world
with intentions to bring celebrities down.

20:50.802 --> 20:53.927
So be mindful of the pictures you post.

20:54.260 --> 20:56.010
("We...")

20:57.675 --> 20:59.302
When there are lots of people around,

21:00.026 --> 21:01.226
be mindful of your surroundings.

21:04.760 --> 21:06.770
("...Made A Promise")

21:12.768 --> 21:13.693
You...

21:13.693 --> 21:15.295
...don't have to worry anymore.

21:16.601 --> 21:19.281
I want to become more adult-like!

21:20.966 --> 21:21.725
I see.

21:22.297 --> 21:23.596
An appropriate distance...

21:26.208 --> 21:27.208
"I want to become an adult"!

21:27.587 --> 21:28.756
Cool and meaningful!

21:28.830 --> 21:29.660
Shut up!

21:29.660 --> 21:31.242
("We Made A Promise")
"I want to become an adult"!
